description: Our family members. Used for system authentication as well as pers
 onal information lookups
objectClass: organizationalUnit
ou: People

dn: ou=Groups,dc=cummings-online,dc=local
description: Authorization and distributed email groups composed of people and
 other groups. Distinguished from roles, which are collections of permissions h
 eld on downstream IT assets
objectClass: organizationalUnit
ou: Groups

