description: Computing and network equipment, including tablets, switches, rou
 ters, and so on
objectClass: organizationalUnit
ou: system

dn: ou=ServiceAccounts,dc=cummings-online,dc=local
description: Entries for machine accounts, aka technical users
objectClass: organizationalUnit
ou: ServiceAccounts

